# Improve skill (project)

This project includes the `improve` skill at:

- `.cursor/skills/improve/SKILL.md`
- `.agents/skills/improve/SKILL.md`

When the user asks to audit the codebase, find improvement opportunities (bugs, security, performance, tests, tech debt, migrations, DX), suggest roadmap/features, or produce handoff plans for another agent to implement — read and follow the `improve` skill before acting.

Do not use the improve skill for normal implementation, bugfix, or feature work unless the user asks for an audit/plan in that mode.
